    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0173" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/1456: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Matthews</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-09-09">September 9,
                        1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>439. Your 499, 5th.<anchor n="60" xml:id="d220-f1"/> After the period of active
                    warfare Department discontinued the practice of providing loans for
                    transportation expenses for Americans who have declined many opportunities
                    afforded them for return to United States. It continues willing upon receipt of
                    names, addresses and amounts desired to communicate with relatives, friends or
                    employers in United States to obtain necessary funds.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
